  {
   "id": "lead-2",
   "section": "(lead)",
   "text": "The agency's name ANNA used to stand for \"Abkhazian Network News Agency\"; after the head office moved to Moscow, when registering in Roskomnadzor on 22 September 2017, \"Abkhazian\" was changed to \"Analytical\".",
   "words": 33,
   "authors": [
